<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:2:71">Dedicated to Helping Individuals and Families in Crisis</h5>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:3:71"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/d66aa8be-9105-4e58-b95b-3484d0e03f67_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:81">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#ffffff;">
                    <h6 style="text-align:center;">Baton Rouge:</h6>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Clothes voucher </strong>– emergency basis only (fire, flood, hurricane, tornado, homeless, etc); need proof of emergency and current LA ID/license; by appointment only. Vouchers can only be claimed at the Coursey Family Store in Baton Rouge.</li>
	<li><strong>Furniture/appliance Voucher </strong>– unable to do at this time</li>
	<li><strong>Energy Assistance </strong>– through Entergy’s Power to Care Program, must be elderly (60 and above) or receive disability, or have a child receiving disability; person applying for assistance must have their name on the bill and live at the address; must present emergency reason for needing assistance, income-based; by appointment only</li>
</ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:5:86"></div>
